{"id":97,"name":"القدر","transliteration":"Al-Qadr","translation_fr":"La destinée","translation_en":"The Power","type":"meccan","total_verses":5,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"إِنَّآ أَنزَلۡنَٰهُ فِي لَيۡلَةِ ٱلۡقَدۡرِ","translation_fr":"Nous l'avons certes, fait descendre (le Coran) pendant la nuit d'Al-Qadr","translation_en":"Indeed, We sent the Qur'an down during the Night of Decree","transliteration":"Inna anzalnahu fee laylati alqadri"},{"id":2,"text":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا لَيۡلَةُ ٱلۡقَدۡرِ","translation_fr":"Et qui te dira ce qu'est la nuit d'Al-Qadr","translation_en":"And what can make you know what is the Night of Decree","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma laylatu alqadri"},{"id":3,"text":"لَيۡلَةُ ٱلۡقَدۡرِ خَيۡرٞ مِّنۡ أَلۡفِ شَهۡرٖ","translation_fr":"La nuit d'Al-Qadr est meilleure que mille mois","translation_en":"The Night of Decree is better than a thousand months","transliteration":"Laylatu alqadri khayrun min alfi shahrin"},{"id":4,"text":"تَنَزَّلُ ٱلۡمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ وَٱلرُّوحُ فِيهَا بِإِذۡنِ رَبِّهِم مِّن كُلِّ أَمۡرٖ","translation_fr":"Durant celle-ci descendent les Anges ainsi que l'Esprit, par permission de leur Seigneur pour tout ordre","translation_en":"The angels and the Spirit descend therein by permission of their Lord for every matter","transliteration":"Tanazzalu almalaikatu waalrroohu feeha biithni rabbihim min kulli amrin"},{"id":5,"text":"سَلَٰمٌ هِيَ حَتَّىٰ مَطۡلَعِ ٱلۡفَجۡرِ","translation_fr":"Elle est paix et salut jusqu'à l'apparition de l'aube","translation_en":"Peace it is until the emergence of dawn","transliteration":"Salamun hiya hatta matlaAAi alfajri"}]}